---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Caller from '../components/Caller';
import { withBase } from '../lib/url';
---
<Layout title="Custom Word Bingo Caller" description="Paste a word list and call it randomly without repeats. Undo, restart, restore after refresh, or import a Bingo Card Kit project for full card checking."><section class="page-intro"><div class="eyebrow">WORDS, WITHOUT NEW CARDS</div><h1>Custom Word Bingo Caller.</h1><p>Already have cards? Draw from your own list without generating or replacing a card set.</p></section><Caller client:load/><article class="article"><h2>Keep words and cards in agreement</h2><p>Paste the same pool used on your cards, then Start. Each word appears once per round. Undo and Next follow the same saved order; Restart explicitly clears calls and reshuffles. Refresh can restore this separate caller when browser storage is available.</p><p>A pasted list cannot prove which words are on a printed card. Check winners manually. Import a Bingo Card Kit project JSON above for its actual layouts and web verification, or use the <a href={withBase('/host/')}>current project host</a>. For handwritten cards use a paper call record.</p><h2>Project a clear call</h2><p>Projection view fills the available browser area with large current-word text. Use your browser’s full-screen control if desired. Screen sharing and audio are handled by you; this tool requests no microphone or camera permission.</p><p><a href={withBase('/how-to-play/')}>Rules and checking</a> · <a href={withBase('/classroom-bingo/')}>Organize a class</a> · <a href={withBase('/family-bingo/')}>Plan a family round</a></p></article></Layout>
